#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:120
msgid ""
"Method called to prepare the test runner. This is called immediately before "
"calling ``self.stage_building()``. The default implementation does nothing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:126
msgid ""
"Method called immediately after the ``self.stage_testing()`` method has been "
"called and the result recorded. This is called even if the test method "
"raised an exception, so the implementation in subclasses may need to be "
"particularly careful about checking the internal state. The default "
"implementation does nothing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:134
msgid "Method called to build source code of a particular test."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:138
msgid ""
"Method called to upload a testing firmware to the target embedded device. "
"This method is ignored on the :ref:`platform_native` development platform."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:144
msgid ""
"Method called to run test cases and record test results via calling ``self."
"test_suite.add_case(TestCase(...))``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:147
msgid ""
"You can implement your own testing method depending on the target where "
"tests are running. For example, connecting to the \"BoardFarm/Remote CI "
"Runner\" via HTTT/TCP, gathering results, parsing them, and recoding via "
"``self.test_suite.add_case(TestCase(...))``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:154
msgid ""
"Method called to configure a SCons build environment in the testing mode. It "
"is uesfult to provide extra runtime configuration for a testing framework "
"(macros, includes, dynamic configs)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:158
msgid ""
