"develop/platformio/test/runners/unity.py>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/custom/api.rst:162
msgid ""
"Method called on receiving data when running tests at the ``stage_testing``. "
"``data`` can be the complete test result output, line, or part of a line. "
"When data are chunked, ``on_testing_data_output`` will be called multiple "
"times until testing is completed."
msgstr ""

